WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
Hi, people, I'll take advantage of the fact that I'm still in the dorm for a bit,

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.740
and film some videos from here,

3
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:06.820
so you can see what student life is like,

4
00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:09.880
and new generations, maybe, if they watch the videos,

5
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.020
will know what awaits them.

6
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:14.400
And my sincere advice to everyone who has the opportunity —

7
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.900
live here.

8
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.220
And here's what my morning looked like today.

9
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.540
I filmed this without editing,

10
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.760
just so there'd be an intro to the new series,

11
00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:23.660
and you'd know what to expect.

12
00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.640
So see you in the next video.

13
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.740
And if you have any requests,

14
00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.620
of course, you can ask me

15
00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:31.380
and write to me in the comments,

16
00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.360
if anyone watches to the end of the video

17
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.320
and if anyone is interested in writing a comment.

18
00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:37.220
Bye!